  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4f57265f2d95884493f924517248368, type: 3}
  m_Name: OldMan 5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialougeText
  paragraphs:
  - Thats all for now travler. Oh my eyes? Well, I can tell you that one...
  - 'Its not as imaginative really. I was riding a fresh bike around Ipswitch. '
  - Its better to ride I think, than to walk. To walk would be to risk them there
    demons and night things that come out around there.
  - Luckily, it was noon. But that meant I had me guard down. No helmet, ya'hear?
  - 'Anyhow, flipped ass over tits on a flat rock on the tarmack road and knocked
    myself square in the forehead on that there curb. '
  - Tossed me eyes right from the sockest into a drain hole! Tried to flush them
    up, but I couldn't get 'em back.
  - It's a damn shame, but I've still got my bikes and my health. It keeps me going.
